{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15108280","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108280","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510827001:":{"text":"偏偏是现在，枪不在身边……","source_cn":"偏偏是现在，枪不在身边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79AE633A47391E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510827002:":{"text":"怎么回事？","source_cn":"怎么回事？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E93FB70774C3CBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510828001:1":{"text":"这些野猪突然睡着了……","source_cn":"这些野猪突然睡着了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0D941471969A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510828002:1":{"text":"……是丰饶神的护佑吗？","source_cn":"……是丰饶神的护佑吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFC73F0A2DBFB0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510828003:0":{"text":"赛图恩还有这种闲心？我怎么不知道。","source_cn":"赛图恩还有这种闲心？我怎么不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0544A0961D8DB6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510828004:1":{"text":"露？我的枪为什么在你手上？","source_cn":"露？我的枪为什么在你手上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A58959111E8EA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::2":{"text":"长枪","source_cn":"长枪","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E832FDFA2858D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510828005:0":{"text":"你分心对付野猪时，从它巢穴里捡来的。","source_cn":"你分心对付野猪时，从它巢穴里捡来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E7665F4991BE08B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510828006:1":{"text":"这是丰饶神赐予我的神圣武器，我——","source_cn":"这是丰饶神赐予我的神圣武器，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507DB8CA05723A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510828007:0":{"text":"不用解释，我是神使，自然知道它是什么。","source_cn":"不用解释，我是神使，自然知道它是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4C6664B262C1A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510828008:1":{"text":"快把它拿走，狩猎神不喜欢赛图恩的气息。","source_cn":"快把它拿走，狩猎神不喜欢赛图恩的气息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF0C9C764E2DFC85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510828009:1":{"text":"露，赛图恩是我信奉的神明，就算信仰不同，也不要在我面前对那位神明出言不逊。","source_cn":"露，赛图恩是我信奉的神明，就算信仰不同，也不要在我面前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87BA40FEE1031F52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510828010:0":{"text":"我讨厌赛图恩，你打算怎么办？你会因此杀了我吗？","source_cn":"我讨厌赛图恩，你打算怎么办？你会因此杀了我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4FCF10FEB053C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510828011:0":{"text":"……杀了你？我不会。","source_cn":"……杀了你？我不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB327000F393905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510828012:0":{"text":"为什么？","source_cn":"为什么？<key:dialog51>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17DCA3A73382F439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510828013:0":{"text":"因为你明知道我经常潜入雅库伯尔的领地，却没有把这个消息告诉你的同族。","source_cn":"因为你明知道我经常潜入雅库伯尔的领地，却没有把这个消息...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C14C82F2BDA9F4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510828014:1":{"text":"你没有伤害我，也没有让其他兽人伤害我，所以我也不会伤害你。","source_cn":"你没有伤害我，也没有让其他兽人伤害我，所以我也不会伤害你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x801B1C4966CC3C80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510828015:0":{"text":"也许我只是还没来得及说。","source_cn":"也许我只是还没来得及说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BCAD0398196FC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510828016:0":{"text":"你不会说的。","source_cn":"你不会说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E5B732E28530499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510828017:0":{"text":"我讨厌自信的人，可是，我似乎并不讨厌你。这真奇怪。","source_cn":"我讨厌自信的人，可是，我似乎并不讨厌你。这真奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A1C41A70748E9D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510828018:1":{"text":"你知道我为呼临而来。","source_cn":"你知道我为呼临而来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D29F8A0744CF943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510828019:0":{"text":"我知道。而且知道，你做不到。","source_cn":"我知道。而且知道，你做不到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A896D7908683AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510828020:1":{"text":"做不到什么？","source_cn":"做不到什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8775A9A08F4ED53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510828021:0":{"text":"发动战争。","source_cn":"发动战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CAD3D59E2BBE0A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510828022:0":{"text":"你当不成猎人。面对敌人，如果不立刻掷出长枪，反而会被盯上，成为猎物。","source_cn":"你当不成猎人。面对敌人，如果不立刻掷出长枪，反而会被盯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8171FFF45505C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510828023:1":{"text":"你不是敌人。我也不希望雅库伯尔成为呼临的敌人。","source_cn":"你不是敌人。我也不希望雅库伯尔成为呼临的敌人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B094B79FF4C0D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510828024:1":{"text":"呼临面对困境，但你们不该被卷入其中。","source_cn":"呼临面对困境，但你们不该被卷入其中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78ED8F5C6A4A3616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510828025:0":{"text":"那么，你要回去了？侦查结束了？","source_cn":"那么，你要回去了？侦查结束了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x421F5F99C2E752C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510828026:1":{"text":"侦查是为了侵入，我会回去劝诫领主和议事官，然后永不再来。","source_cn":"侦查是为了侵入，我会回去劝诫领主和议事官，然后永不再来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F61377A4026036D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510828027:0":{"text":"……珀尔修斯，你永远都不会伤害我吗？","source_cn":"……珀尔修斯，你永远都不会伤害我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F2A5513BE2240AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510828028:1":{"text":"不会。","source_cn":"不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17303D442F14E5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1510828029:0":{"text":"你保证？","source_cn":"你保证？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x953E6625DCE52453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510828030:1":{"text":"我保证。","source_cn":"我保证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824A6136F9F66844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1510828031:1":{"text":"那么，再在这里相见吧。就在这里，仅你和我，再无他人。","source_cn":"那么，再在这里相见吧。就在这里，仅你和我，再无他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24FE26B5D4AE46B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1510828032:0":{"text":"怎么偏偏断在这里？真让人着急。","source_cn":"怎么偏偏断在这里？真让人着急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8F55E40A98D98D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1510828033:0":{"text":"摩根，我才知道你喜欢看这些。","source_cn":"摩根，我才知道你喜欢看这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F500E7771F722E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1510828034:0":{"text":"气氛都到这了，我总得给点反应捧个场吧。","source_cn":"气氛都到这了，我总得给点反应捧个场吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD70F504FD4AB46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:42:1510827001:":{"text":"偏偏是现在，枪不在身边……","source_cn":"偏偏是现在，枪不在身边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79AE633A47391E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:42:1510827002:":{"text":"怎么回事？","source_cn":"怎